      "description": "Package Included:\n 1 x Electric ratchet wrench\n 1 x charger (UK)\n 2x battery\n 1 x manual\n Note: Send plug adapters according to your country/region\n \n \n \n feature:\n ● One-handed operation: compact and convenient, easy to use and operate.\n ● Powerful copper wire motor: high temperature resistant and safer.\n ● Quick sleeve replacement: the quick chuck shape is aligned, and the sleeve replacement is quick and convenient.\n ● Rotate clockwise and counterclockwise, with low noise and long service life.\n ● Positive and negative dials, one-key switch for disassembly and assembly, convenient screw tightening.\n ● Lengthened switch button, flexible operation.\n ● With LED light: suitable for operation in a dark environment.\n ● Efficient heat dissipation: strong heat dissipation, no machine burning.\n ● Comfortable grip: The handle wrapped in soft rubber feels comfortable.\n ●【R/F positive and negative design】:\n Special R/F positive and negative design, easy to disassemble and assemble.\n ●[6000mAh large capacity battery]:\n Use 6000mAh large-capacity lithium battery to ensure longer battery life. The charging can be completed in 40-50 minutes, and the working time is about 40 minutes.\n ●[3/8''square head]:\n Using a 3/8\" manganese steel spindle, the metal ball is clamped accurately, and the sleeve can be disassembled without disassembly.\n ●[3cm nose width]:\n The width of the machine head is only 3CM, suitable for small space operation, electric preloading and manual reinforcement.\n ●【LED work light design】:\n The LED work light automatically lights up during work, which is convenient for working in the dark.\n ●【Slip handle】:\n The ergonomically designed non-slip handle makes the screwdriver turn easier and reduces hand fatigue.\n ●【Widely used】:\n It can be widely used in truss installation, wedding stage construction, automobile maintenance, mechanical maintenance, etc.",
